This package reproduces the startup header of pi-claude-code-tui
(https://github.com/Phoobobo/pi-claude-code-tui), Copyright (c) 2026 Phoobobo,
licensed under the MIT License.

Derived material (from that project's extensions/claude-code-startup.ts and
extensions/render-utils.ts):

- The box layout: the rounded border with the `Pi v<version>` label, the boxed
  body rows and the two-column body.
- The tips sidebar: its headings, the `Ask Pi to build it` line, the short rule
  and the pool-and-sample tip selection.
- The width helpers: center, padRight, headerColumnWidths, formatCwd,
  formatModelLabel, pickSlashCommandTips and collectPiCommandNames.

LOON changes:

- Every colour resolves from the active pi theme through
  extensions/lib/palette.ts, so the header never emits an SGR colour of its own.
- The animated upstream logo (22 frames of three-column cells, each frame
  coloured with raw SGR codes) is replaced by a static 4 x 4 block Pi mark
  (12 x 4 cells) drawn in the theme accent: extensions/lib/logo.ts. It is LOON's
  own glyph, measured from the owner's reference capture.
- The vertical divider sits at a fixed 69% of the interior.
- Commands are use-loon-tui (reapply) and use-default-tui (restore).
- The working-message verbs, footer, spinner and window title are not touched.

The upstream MIT license follows verbatim.

